{"id":"a7417d6cf99a4226","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-thm-filter-density.md","title":"Kappa-Complete Filter Lower-Bound Characterization","display":"thm-filter-density — Kappa-Complete Filter Lower-Bound Characterization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-filter-density","aliases":["58-thm-filter-density"],"display":"thm-filter-density — Kappa-Complete Filter Lower-Bound Characterization","depends_on":["[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter]]","[[58-df-proper-filter]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-filter-density"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-filter-density</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-filter-density — Kappa-Complete Filter Lower-Bound Characterization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56914510091eed27\" href=\"?note=56914510091eed27\" title=\"58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter\">58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1590a03f63f7fb6f\" href=\"?note=1590a03f63f7fb6f\" title=\"58-df-proper-filter\">58-df-proper-filter</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> (proper filter on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (nonzero cardinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperFilter}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperFilter}\\)</span> (proper-filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1590a03f63f7fb6f\" href=\"?note=1590a03f63f7fb6f\" title=\"58-df-proper-filter\">58-df-proper-filter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S\\)</span> (canonical predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"56914510091eed27\" href=\"?note=56914510091eed27\" title=\"58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter\">58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}filter\\text{-}density}\\vdash\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(F,X,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ProperFilter}(F,X)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\kappa\\ne0\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq F\\;\\left(|\\mathcal A|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\exists Z\\in F\\;\\forall Y\\in\\mathcal A\\;(Z\\subseteq Y)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}filter\\text{-}density}\\vdash\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(F,X,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ProperFilter}(F,X)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\kappa\\ne0\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq F\\;\\left(|\\mathcal A|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\exists Z\\in F\\;\\forall Y\\in\\mathcal A\\;(Z\\subseteq Y)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Under reverse inclusion, the displayed common-lower-bound condition is equivalent to closure under intersections of fewer than <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> filter members.</li>\n<li>The atom therefore characterizes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-completeness; it does not introduce a separate, ambiguous notion of “filter density.”</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter","status":"resolved","id":"56914510091eed27","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-proper-filter","status":"resolved","id":"1590a03f63f7fb6f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-proper-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\kappa$ (nonzero cardinal, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-proper-filter","status":"resolved","id":"1590a03f63f7fb6f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProperFilter}$ (proper-filter predicate, see [[58-df-proper-filter]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter","status":"resolved","id":"56914510091eed27","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S$ (canonical predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProperFilter}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}filter\\text{-}density}\\vdash\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(F,X,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ProperFilter}(F,X)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\kappa\\ne0\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq F\\;\\left(|\\mathcal A|<\\kappa\\to\\exists Z\\in F\\;\\forall Y\\in\\mathcal A\\;(Z\\subseteq Y)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1403,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4147","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-thm-filter-density.md|58-thm-filter-density]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1","56914510091eed27","1590a03f63f7fb6f"]}